    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54367" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταλεκτέον</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-έα</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one must
				reckon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦτον ἐς τοὺς κόλλοπας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eub.
					11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταλεκτέος, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
					<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, <i>to be drawn
			up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἂν εῐη κατάλογος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					968c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be reckoned</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῷ αὐτῷ ἀριθμῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Nob.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			.</div>
